      "comment": "Ultimate Calamity: Post-Apocalyptic Elysium",
      "content": "An apocalypse bunker in Wavechaser Plain built during the Belyi Tsar's reign. Its inhabitants were made to believe the Cataclysm had destroyed the outside world. Researchers developed kuuvahki-absorbing plants and an Apocalypse Purification System, but Supervisor Morozov used them to spread corruption. The bunker is entered in Return to Sender.\n\nA bloodstained diary shows that a treasure hunter was lured in by a signal and trapped; the Treasure Hoarders' marks are carved on the walls.",
